      "id": "claim_2ba967afc61349c9b7f820e31e7cbee7",
      "statement": "`Pipeline.run()` keeps explicit A2A protocol delegation separate from automatic multi-agent dispatch: explicit delegation creates and routes one task and returns early only for completed/working state, while automatic dispatch occurs after routing only for enabled, eligible, non-nested work whose decomposition has at least two subtasks.",
